    "Macro Extreme": "Tight pixel-level macro with visible RGB structure and shallow focus.",
    "Close Up Low": "Low-angle close-up with a soft far edge.",
    "Pixel Peep": "Front-on magnification that prioritizes the LCD pixel matrix.",
    "Sideways": "Strong horizontal perspective with restrained edge fringing.",
    "Steep Side": "The most oblique photographic angle with aggressive depth falloff.",
    "Pan Down": "Lower target framing that reads like a downward camera pan.",
    "Dutch Roll": "A clean macro view with a pronounced diagonal horizon.",
    "Side Focus Pull": "Side view with slow, visible focus travel.",
    "Handheld Drift": "Subtle seeded target, angle, and focus movement.",
    "Slow Push": "Very low-frequency Z drift that feels like a careful camera push.",
    "Focus Hunt": "Static framing with deliberate shallow-focus searching.",
    "Orbit Wide": "Wider environmental view with a slow angular float.",
    "Cool Night": "Cool white balance, darker exposure, and deeper vignette.",
    "Dusty Lens": "Visible but photographic dust, grain, and edge falloff.",
